				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "聚焦"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，只显示该项及其标题，反向链接也限定到该项；是否包含子块沿用现有设置。选择 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "退出聚焦"
				},
				{
